                "entry_id": "70d708ea-19aa-3a92-a13e-4b677208dadf",
                "word": "chemtrail",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "04d1494a-fdfa-40a3-b225-31e7c61bb7de",
                        "entry_id": "70d708ea-19aa-3a92-a13e-4b677208dadf",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "chemtrails"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3d9c16c3-e4a0-3b9f-8547-de828adfc695",
                        "entry_id": "70d708ea-19aa-3a92-a13e-4b677208dadf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A contrail consisting of chemicals or biological agents deliberately sprayed at high altitudes, according to certain conspiracy theories."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "in-plural",
                            "often"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "efae3752-7cbe-479f-ae6a-8b5bae10e047",
                                "sense_id": "3d9c16c3-e4a0-3b9f-8547-de828adfc695",
                                "text": "You and me watching / Chemtrails is where we belong / That's what I mean when we talk in this jetstream"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09638b60-f914-4728-af89-9942f921e88a",
                                "sense_id": "3d9c16c3-e4a0-3b9f-8547-de828adfc695",
                                "text": "“We are going to stop this crime,” Kennedy [RFK Jr], who is known for his contrarian stances on vaccines and offshore wind farms, wrote about chemtrails on X in August.[…] Now, scientists are faced with a resurgent focus on chemtrails amid a related, more substantive, debate over whether actual modifications to the Earth’s atmosphere should be made in a desperate attempt to slow global heating."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d24817aa-513f-48a1-8372-28fd440fc6f5",
                                "sense_id": "3d9c16c3-e4a0-3b9f-8547-de828adfc695",
                                "text": "Conspiracy theories have become so mainstream that they are even prompting nonsensical legislation. Earlier this month, Louisiana lawmakers sent a bill to the state’s governor seeking to ban “chemtrails” – which don’t actually exist. […] Lawmakers in at least 11 other states are trying to advance similar “chemtrail” bans."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3b1e2fef-a700-4e1c-8ce6-cd4ca303f828",
                        "source_entry_id": "70d708ea-19aa-3a92-a13e-4b677208dadf",
                        "source_sense_id": "3d9c16c3-e4a0-3b9f-8547-de828adfc695",
                        "source_sense_description": "contrail consisting of chemicals or biological agents",
                        "target_lang_word": "chemtrail",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chemtrail",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e449089-5e59-3563-b41a-4f0acad5abdb",
                                        "entry_id": "4a6df9eb-8195-393e-8b31-29410d6b2c1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Trainée blanche prétendument composées de produits chimiques, créée par le passage d’avion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Anglicism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd9304eb-4fea-4cb4-ab49-8cf7385439fa",
                                                "sense_id": "2e449089-5e59-3563-b41a-4f0acad5abdb",
                                                "text": "De Météo France, dont les relevés météo passent à nuageux quand il fait beau mais qu’il y a trop de chemtrails dans le ciel et qui diffuse la propagande de l’Organisation Mondiale Météorologique en présentant sur son site des nuages appelés \"cirrus fibratus\", qui sont des « nuages » de chemtrails."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee9eff61-8b83-434b-9443-5314d8f97d5e",
                                                "sense_id": "2e449089-5e59-3563-b41a-4f0acad5abdb",
                                                "text": "Aujourd’hui, une vidéo sur TikTok fait un lien entre cette histoire et la théorie des « chemtrails », qui avance que certaines traînées blanches créées par le passage des avions sont composées d’agents chimiques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51b875be-8ee0-4db8-9d42-dbfcc93092f8",
                                                "sense_id": "2e449089-5e59-3563-b41a-4f0acad5abdb",
                                                "text": "Des pluies torrentielles s’abattent sur Dubaï ? Une injection de produits chimiques dans les nuages doit en être la cause. Des inondations records au Brésil ? « Ouvrons les yeux », tweete une internaute, « c’est l’œuvre des chemtrails »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "665ad9f6-c9ab-44a9-b975-c9de6b639b11",
                        "source_entry_id": "70d708ea-19aa-3a92-a13e-4b677208dadf",
                        "source_sense_id": "3d9c16c3-e4a0-3b9f-8547-de828adfc695",
                        "source_sense_description": "contrail consisting of chemicals or biological agents",
                        "target_lang_word": "Chemtrail",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Chemtrail",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de8e525c-c421-3d3c-bb6e-006770104cb3",
                                        "entry_id": "bc2e17cb-a280-34d2-8f8c-55736585c393",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Kondensstreifen, der angeblich neben Wasserdampf gezielt ausgebrachte Chemikalien enthält, mit denen je nach Quelle das Wetter, das Klima oder menschliches Verhalten manipuliert oder Menschen vergiftet werden sollen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e79da33a-fbf4-47ff-8eb9-cd2d18e5e212",
                                                "sense_id": "de8e525c-c421-3d3c-bb6e-006770104cb3",
                                                "text": "Die Theorien darüber, was in Chemtrails enthalten sein soll, reichen von Aluminium über Plutonium bis Mikrochips."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97e8fa5d-52fa-4e5f-bf80-fedd26a25f31",
                                                "sense_id": "de8e525c-c421-3d3c-bb6e-006770104cb3",
                                                "text": "„Die Chemtrails sind das derzeit liebste Steckenpferd deutscher Verschwörungstheoretiker und Spökenkieker, die auch auf Web-Seiten und in zahlreichen Newsgroups ihrem Spleen frönen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24aeb036-ac50-41cb-b70d-96d40ade67bf",
                                                "sense_id": "de8e525c-c421-3d3c-bb6e-006770104cb3",
                                                "text": "„In der ersten Sendung wird es um Ufos, Beamen und Chemtrails gehen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98acdd97-bf59-4dc3-90f4-1b29e68dfc35",
                                                "sense_id": "de8e525c-c421-3d3c-bb6e-006770104cb3",
                                                "text": "„Es gibt keine Chemtrail-Sichtungen, weil es keine Chemtrails gibt. Zu sehen sind ganz normale Kondensstreifen von ganz normalen Flugzeugen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
